# ACE sidecar for wiki/models/minimax-m3.md  (subject: aiw:minimax-m3)
# Controlled-English restatement of the page's assertable facts.
# Proper names (Minimax-M3, Minimax, Domain-Models, Domain-Coding,
# Subcategory-Coding-Model, Tag-Agentic, Swe-Bench, Swe-Bench-Pro, Terminal-Bench,
# Terminal-Bench-2-1, Mcp-Atlas, Posttrainbench, Novita, Vercel-Ai-Gateway,
# Cloudflare-Workers-Ai, and the Minimax-*-Result individuals) compile to aiw:<slug>
# — no lexicon entry needed.
#
# CONTESTED-CLAIM NOTE: the page calls MiniMax M3 a "claimed open-weight frontier
# model" but states weights and parameter count were NOT disclosed at launch, making
# the "open-weight" label contested. We therefore do NOT assert
# `Minimax-M3 has-license-model the open-weights-license.` as settled fact. Instead we
# assert the settled negative facts (weights/parameter-count not disclosed). See the
# extraction map for the full justification.

