Minimax-M3 is a model.
Minimax-M3 has-domain Domain-Models.
Minimax-M3 has-domain Domain-Coding.
Minimax-M3 has-subcategory Subcategory-Coding-Model.
Minimax-M3 has-tag Tag-Agentic.
Minimax-M3 has an as-of-date that is "2026-06-02".

